Z||000057||Voytek||11-29-2001||03:05 PM||||This is funny stuff.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ok, ok.  My opinion?  Oh, you didn't ask  for it?  Well, here it comes, anyway.<P>I love driving my Fiero, even though I'd like it to have some collectors' value in the future.  I am a supporter of 'enjoy it while you can'.  I also do think that buying an SUV and driving it like a car (always) is a waste of money (Steve N.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<B>BUT</B>, I do think that people have the right to do what they want with their vehicles.  And MOST importantly, I dislike people who get in your face about something they believe in and say you should be just like them.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Yeah...<BR>Slap some Nitrous on BS95's FACE<BR>And don't let him exhale...<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Cozmo -  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (giggly)<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
